_pdbx_entry_details.entry_id                 1CKN 
_pdbx_entry_details.compound_details         
;THE TWO MOLECULES IN THE ASYMMETRIC UNIT ARE IN DIFFERENT
CONFORMATIONS.  THE PROTEIN IS MONOMERIC AND THIS ENTRY
MERELY REPRESENTS A CO-CRYSTAL OF THE ENZYME IN TWO
DIFFERENT CONFORMATIONS.  THE ACTIVE SITE LYSINE (B 82)
IS GUANYLYLATED ONLY IN MOLECULE B.  GTP IS NON-COVALENTLY
BOUND TO THE ACTIVE SITE IN MOLECULE A.
;
